{"id": "t148-001", "text": "Pedro's driving test is sometime next week, third attempt. Said he can't sleep thinking about it. Remind me to text him good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't sleep thinking about it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-002", "text": "Emily back from Lisbon. Flight home was delayed 6 hrs, she landed at 2am and went straight into work the next day. Mad. She said the trip itself was lovely though, rented a little flat in Alfama with her partner and did a day trip to Sintra. They're already talking about going back over the summer, maybe Porto this time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2am"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-003", "text": "call w Naledi - her manager Ruth is leaving end of the month, Naledi might go for the role", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruth", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "might go for the role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
