{"id": "t148-007", "text": "So Amy's audition for the conservatoire is on the 14th and she's been rehearsing nonstop. Her mum is flying over from Dublin the day before to go with her. Amy says she's fine but she was biting her nails the whole time we talked. I should send her something that morning, just a short message, nothing that piles on pressure.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the conservatoire", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-008", "text": "Milan and his wife are off to Japan for three weeks in April, first proper holiday since the twins. Their neighbour is minding the dog, a big old lab called Biscuit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lab called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t148-009", "text": "Sean - new client meeting thurs, he's presenting. hates public speaking", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new client meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates public speaking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t148-010", "text": "Malik's boss gave him a hard time in his review yesterday. He's thinking about looking elsewhere sometime after Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-011", "text": "don't forget to ask Chioma how her results day went, she was dreading the chemistry one", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Chioma how her results day went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the chemistry one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t148-012", "text": "Demi's flying to Lagos for her cousin's wedding mid November. Long flight, she's not looking forward to the layover in Paris.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not looking forward to the layover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t148-013", "text": "Kwame has started at the new firm, in-house legal team. Says the people are nice but the commute is brutal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in-house legal team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute is brutal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-014", "text": "Hugo told me the Barcelona trip is off, Tamar's work wouldn't give her the time off because of the merger. He was pretty fed up about it, they'd already paid for the hotel. They're doing a long weekend in the Lakes instead, end of October, and hoping to rebook Spain for early spring. Ask him if they got the hotel money back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long weekend in the Lakes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rebook Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him if they got the hotel money back", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
