{"id": "t148-018", "text": "Louis said his sister Zofia got into the Royal Ballet School!! Starting in September. Whole family's going down for the first day", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the Royal Ballet School", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t148-019", "text": "Ethan in the lift: his manager is going on paternity leave sometime next month and Ethan is covering. Bit nervous about it, never managed people before. Should take him for a coffee the week after to see how it's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
