{"id": "t148-028", "text": "Emily's brother Sam is moving to Melbourne at the end of the month. She's taking it harder than she lets on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Melbourne", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it harder than she lets on", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t148-029", "text": "voice note: right so Naledi called, she had the interview with the client side this morning, thinks it went okay, they said they'd let her know by the end of the week. Also her flatmate's cat Pepper had kittens, five of them, she's keeping one. Remind me to ask her about the job on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with the client side", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had kittens", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeping one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her about the job", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-030", "text": "Salma and Isaac are going to Morocco for New Year. Their first trip abroad as a couple.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Morocco", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "New Year", "anchor": "e1"}]}
