{"id": "t148-033", "text": "Note to self: quarterly review with Malik's team moved to the 30th. Prep slides the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quarterly review", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Prep slides", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-034", "text": "Milan says the client from Rotterdam is a nightmare, keeps changing the brief. Mtg w them again early next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "client from Rotterdam is a nightmare", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Mtg w them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-035", "text": "Sean's presentation went really well, the client signed. He was relieved afterwards. His wife Chioma's due in December btw, first baby.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presentation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-036", "text": "Demi back from Lagos. Wedding was huge, 600 people. She's jetlagged and has to be back in court the next morning", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "jetlagged", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back in court", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-037", "text": "Kwame - into bouldering, goes Tues and Thurs, wants a new chalk bag", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes Tues and Thurs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new chalk bag", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-038", "text": "remind me to ring Uncle Hugo sometime this week, his knee op was yesterday", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Uncle Hugo", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-039", "text": "Tamar said her daughter has her driving test on the 18th. Tamar's taking her and has to wait in the car park for an hour afterwards. She's more nervous than the kid", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "an hour afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kid", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t148-040", "text": "Aleksander's flying to Krakow over half term to see his parents, his dad's not been well. Ask him how his dad's doing when he's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Krakow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not been well", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how his dad's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-041", "text": "Ayesha resigned today. Last day is end of the month, then she's going travelling in South America for six months, starting in Lima and ending up in Patagonia. Her boyfriend Louis is quitting too and going with her. Leaving do sometime the week before. Don't forget to get a card going round the team for her, and maybe a decent travel backpack as a group present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "resigned", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling in South America", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quitting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week before", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card going round the team for her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a decent travel backpack as a group present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
