{"id": "t148-053", "text": "Pedro said his girlfriend Kiri has the final round of her law firm interviews early next week. Two days of assessments, then a partner interview the day after. She's terrified about the group exercise. I should text her the morning of the first day, and maybe ask Pedro the week after if she's heard anything back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final round of her law firm interviews", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "partner interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified about the group exercise", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of the first day", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Pedro the week after if she's heard anything back", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
