{"id": "t148-057", "text": "Isaac's piano exam went well, he thinks a merit. Results come out a few weeks after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-058", "text": "Chioma had the baby! Little girl, born Tuesday night. Sean's on leave until the end of the month. Must get a gift for them, maybe the cot mobile she mentioned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had the baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a gift for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cot mobile she mentioned", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-059", "text": "Malik's moving to Bristol with his partner sometime in the spring, his partner got a job at the university there. He'll go remote, his manager's already signed it off. They're viewing flats the weekend after next. He's a bit anxious about leaving his mates and his football team behind, but says it's the right call.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a job at the university", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "go remote", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing flats", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football team", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t148-060", "text": "Kwame and Demi just got back from their trip, Iceland was incredible apparently. Saw the northern lights the night before they left.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before they left", "anchor": "e1"}]}
